# Synthetic TATT example with explicit independent-pilot compression and Percival likelihood.
# Teaching configuration; not a reproduction of the published estimator, priors, compression or posterior.
# Run EXAMPLE_COMPRESSION.ipynb to create the fixed independent-pilot matrix; its historical derivative basis is not a current accuracy validation.
# Ns=796 and independent Gaussian mocks are explicit approximations. Four footprints from one full sky need an independence assessment.
# The ordinary supplied sample covariance is used without Hartlap or PME correction. Compression is applied to data, mean and both covariance axes.
# The baseline synthetic mean uses recorded source clipping. All 480 rows enter before explicit compression; no hidden scale cut is made.
# Uniform sigma8 and the demonstration priors differ from published inference. Posterior reproduction is not established.

two_point_file = upstream_y3/data/dv/sim_2pt-NLA-cosmoCosmogrid-04Nov24.fits
aperture_file = upstream_y3/data/dv/sim_map3_emu-NLA-cosmoCosmogrid-24FEBRUARY2025_WITH_COV.fits
cov_file = upstream_y3/data/covariance/xip_xim_map3_covariance_8ARCMINCUT_25Feb25.fits
nz_source_file = demonstration/y3_demo_sources.fits
source_ntomo = 4
data_file = demonstration/y3_tatt_synthetic.txt
mask_file =
compression_file = ../chains/independent_pilot_compression.npz
mock_count = 796
parameter_count = 18
